# Extra syscalls for the software codec service (com.android.media.swcodec), appended to the
# APEX's own seccomp policy by mediaswcodec. Mapping a gralloc buffer goes through minigbm's
# gbm_mesa backend, which creates a Mesa screen: Mesa's CPU detection calls sched_getaffinity
# and sysinfo, its worker threads sched_setaffinity, its shader cache mkdirat. Without them the
# service dies with SIGSYS as soon as a video decoder writes a frame. GloDroid's
# codecs/mediaswcodec.policy plus sched_setaffinity (Mesa 26).
sysinfo: 1
sched_getaffinity: 1
sched_setaffinity: 1
mkdirat: 1
